{
  "info": {
    "name": "PetMate",
    "description": "Collection complète de l'API PetMate (Spring Boot). Tous les endpoints REST actuels du backend, organisés par domaine.\n\n## Démarrage rapide (workflow recommandé)\n1. Importer ce fichier unique : il contient **tous les endpoints ET les variables** (collection autonome, aucun environnement à créer).\n2. Adapter les variables de collection (``baseUrl``, ``email``, ``password``, ``REGISTER_EMAIL``…) aux comptes à tester.\n3. Exécuter **1. Auth → Login** : les tokens sont sauvegardés automatiquement dans les variables de collection.\n3. Exécuter **2. Profil → GET /users/me** : ``myUserId`` et ``petId`` sont capturés automatiquement.\n4. Dérouler ensuite les dossiers dans l'ordre : Pets → Matching → Messagerie → Notifications → Blocages → Signalements → Uploads.\n\n## Notes importantes\n- L'envoi d'emails passe par un SMTP de dev (``localhost:1025``). Les liens/\"tokens\" (vérification email, reset de mot de passe, code 6 chiffres) sont visibles dans les logs du conteneur SMTP (MailHog : ``http://localhost:8025``) ou directement utilisables : ``POST /auth/verify-code`` avec le code à 6 chiffres.\n- **Inscription** : le backend exige au moins un ``pet`` (``pets @NotEmpty``) → un ``400`` sans pet est attendu. Le body fourni en contient un.\n- ``DELETE /users/me`` **supprime définitivement le compte** : à exécuter sur un compte jetable uniquement.\n- Les ids dynamiques (``petId``, ``otherUserId``, ``targetPetId``, ``matchId``, ``conversationId``, ``notificationId``) se remplissent automatiquement via les tests des requêtes précédentes. Ils restent modifiables dans les variables de collection.\n\n## Temps réel (WebSocket STOMP)\n- Endpoint : ``ws://localhost:8080/ws`` (SockJS/STOMP).\n- AUTH au CONNECT : header ``Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>`` (même JWT que REST).\n- Envoyer sur ``/app/typing`` : ``{\"conversationId\": <id>, \"typing\": true}``.\n- Recevoir sur ``/user/queue/conversations.{id}`` : messages poussés après envoi.\n- Recevoir sur ``/user/queue/conversations.{id}.typing`` : statut \"en train d'écrire\".\n- Recevoir sur ``/user/queue/notifications`` : événements de notifications.\nLes messages et le typing sont aussi testables 100% en REST (POST message / POST typing).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "azerr@gmail.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "azerr@2026", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "myUserId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "petId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "otherUserId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "targetPetId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "matchId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "conversationId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notificationId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "VERIFY_CODE", "value": "123456", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "VERIFY_TOKEN", "value": "PASTE_TOKEN_ICI", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "RESET_TOKEN", "value": "PASTE_TOKEN_ICI", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "NEW_PASSWORD", "value": "NewPass!123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "PASS_CODE", "value": "123456", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "REGISTER_EMAIL", "value": "newuser@gmail.com", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/register (créer un compte)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Jean\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Dupont\",\n  \"email\": \"{{REGISTER_EMAIL}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"profilePicture\": \"\",\n  \"bio\": \"Amoureux des chiens\",\n  \"latitude\": 48.8566,\n  \"longitude\": 2.3522,\n  \"searchRadius\": 30,\n  \"pets\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Rex\",\n      \"type\": \"DOG\",\n      \"breed\": \"Labrador\",\n      \"gender\": \"MALE\",\n      \"age\": 3,\n      \"energyLevel\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"description\": \"Très joueur\",\n      \"vaccinated\": true,\n      \"neutered\": false,\n      \"photos\": [\n        { \"url\": \"https://example.com/rex.jpg\", \"primaryPhoto\": true, \"displayOrder\": 0 }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /auth/verify-email?token=",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email?token={{VERIFY_TOKEN}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "verify-email"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "token", "value": "{{VERIFY_TOKEN}}" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/verify-code (code 6 chiffres)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Vérification OK\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-code",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "verify-code"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{VERIFY_CODE}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/resend-verification",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-verification",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "resend-verification"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{REGISTER_EMAIL}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/login (sauvegarde les tokens)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Login 200 + tokens\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(data.accessToken).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"rememberMe\": false\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/forgot-password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "forgot-password"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/reset-password (token par email)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "reset-password"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{RESET_TOKEN}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"{{NEW_PASSWORD}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/refresh",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Refresh OK\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', pm.response.json().accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', pm.response.json().refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Profil et compte (Bearer)",
      "item": [
